  unitName: Homusubi
  unitId: 10273
  unitNumber: 415
  description: A disastrous beast that long ago was a great threat to the Sama Kingdom.
    The embodiment of mayhem itself, even sturdy castles were turned to ash when
    he came raging in. In order to stop Homusubi from destroying the world, the gods
    utilized a powerful freezing weapon to seal away the majority of his power. However,
    even then the Fiery Beast continued to be a great threat, and it's been told
    there were many more kingdoms that experienced his rage.
  summonDesc: Foolish Summoner!<br>You've awoken me once more!<br>You'll regret your
    arrogance!
  fusionDesc: Ha ha ha ha!<br>Take a look, Summoner!<br>My flames burn bright!
